Node ID=60 disjunction
Text=A great calamity that changed the world, so many centuries ago. It heralded an age of magic and darkness that we struggle against to this day. If not for the courage of King Richard and the first Knights Templar, the evil unleashed by the Disjunction would have claimed the Earth.
Should Have Voiceover=1

