Node ID=70 darkness
Text=The first Disjunction long ago unleashed many dark creatures into the world. In the past, goblins, titans, ogres, dragons, and creatures from the grave all plagued our cities. The Knights Templar launched a series of crusades with the Knights of Saladin to drive the darkness back. We control most of Europe today, but evil still exists in the shadows, so we must always be vigilant.
Should Have Voiceover=1

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=I have other questions.
